{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p003436","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p003436"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p003436","label":"尾生（陳丞相世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"legendary_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"尾生","mention_ids":["c-shiji-056-chen:m007-0144"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m007-0144","chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p007","quote":"尾生"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-056-chen","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-056","chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-056-chen:m007-0144"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-056-chen:p007"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-056-chen"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m007-0144","start":144,"end":146,"surface":"尾生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003436","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p007","chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji056-019","person_id":"cbr-p003436","surfaces":["尾生"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-056-chen"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p007","quote":"絳侯、灌嬰等咸讒陳平曰：「平雖美丈夫，如冠玉耳，其中未必有也。臣聞平居家時，盜其嫂；事魏不容，亡歸楚；歸楚不中，又亡歸漢。今日大王尊官之，令護軍。臣聞平受諸將金，金多者得善處，金少者得惡處。平，反覆亂臣也，願王察之。」漢王疑之，召讓魏無知。無知曰：「臣所言者，能也；陛下所問者，行也。今有尾生、孝己之行而無益處於勝負之數，陛下何暇用之乎？楚漢相距，臣進奇謀之士，顧其計誠足以利國家不耳。且盜嫂受金又何足疑乎？」漢王召讓平曰：「先生事魏不中，遂事楚而去，今又從吾遊，信者固多心乎？」平曰：「臣事魏王，魏王不能用臣説，故去事項王。項王不能信人，其所任愛，非諸項即妻之昆弟，雖有奇士不能用，平乃去楚。聞漢王之能用人，故歸大王。臣躶身來，不受金無以爲資。誠臣計畫有可采者，顧大王用之；使無可用者，金具在，請封輸官，得請骸骨。」漢王乃謝，厚賜，拜爲護軍中尉，盡護諸將。諸將乃不敢復言。"}],"rationale":"依本篇明示名字、局部主語、授官爵與家世暫接。平城與負郭不